      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "perf(repair): stage validation proof gates",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- plan repair validation as ordered, risk-aware proof stages and independently rebuild exact proof semantics before replay\n- keep untrusted execution credential-free and lifecycle-script-free; bind immutable source, base, head, action, and output identities\n- publish only exact independently validated commit and tree bytes through credential-scoped mutation jobs\n- recheck live pause and structured security signals at every mutation boundary\n- checkpoint replacement publication before irreversible source closeout and recover only the exact authorized replacement PR\n- make retryable post-flight outcomes visible and durable for self-heal\n- resolve rerun handoff artifacts by trusted producer artifact ID and digest instead of consumer attempt names\n- reject unsafe command aliases and options, source mutation, proof drift, and terminal runtime budgets\n\n## Final hardening\n\n- revalidate every sealed issue and PR source in the shared guard immediately before privileged push/create/reopen/label/comment/close mutations\n- allow source drift only for the exact prepared source head or a closure recorded by the verified publication checkpoint\n- fail closed when a configured canonical changed-gate script disappears\n- allow only narrow read-only package-manager proof forms; reject lifecycle, registry, and account mutations across pnpm, npm, Bun, and Yarn\n- keep deadline-expired pending or missing checks retryable for durable self-heal\n- snapshot ignored dependency/tooling inputs and symlink targets around every staged proof command\n- verify every applicable strict ruleset, including bypass actors and the full effective required-check set\n- bind issue-implementation readiness to the exact head in the verified publication receipt\n\n## Validation\n\n- exact head: `d4e6e7db6052acaae628c9f1713ea4f52d46b428`\n- Node 26.5.0 / pnpm 11.10.0\n- focused hardening suites: execution handoff 25/25; post-flight 16/16; target validation 72/72; strict binding/post-flight 36/36\n- full unit suite: 922/922 passed\n- full repair suite: 839/839 passed\n- changed coverage: 100% lines, 86.90% branches, 100% functions\n- aggregate coverage: 73.17% lines, 72.19% branches, 83.26% functions\n- direct `pnpm run check` equivalents passed: active-surface and limits checks, all three TypeScript builds, all four lint lanes, unit and repair suites, changed and aggregate coverage, and formatter check on 350 files\n- the pnpm script wrapper refused before execution because it attempted a non-TTY reinstall of the shared `node_modules` (`ERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY`); no install or dependency replacement was performed\n- GitHub checks: 6/6 passed, including `pnpm check`, CodeQL for Actions and JavaScript/TypeScript, and the Windows Codex launcher\n",
        "branch": "perf/staged-proof-gates",
